"name":"actor_appear","args":[2,64,70,0,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[5,52,58,3,11]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[11,52,52,3,11]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[201,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["许都  相府"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n什么？大败？\n&曹仁\n是的，请恕属下无能。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[21,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n什么……！"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[21,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n为什么？\n&曹操\n虽然关羽、张飞是天下少有的猛将，\n你们毕竟也已身经百战了，\n怎么还会败得灰头土脸的……\n&李典\n我们之所以会失败，\n是因为我军智谋不及刘备的军师徐庶。\n&曹操\n军师徐庶？\n没听说过这个名字。\n&曹仁\n此人足智多谋，令人生畏，\n他识破了我们的阵形和行动。\n&曹操\n嗯……\n&李典\n末将既已战败，\n岂有辩解之理，\n还请丞相处置。\n&曹操\n算了。\n&曹仁\n啊？\n……主公您？\n&曹操\n我说算了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n胜败乃兵家常事，\n这也是无可奈何的。\n各位辛苦了，下去歇息吧。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹仁\n是。\n&李典\n是！"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,11,0,98,52,1]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,5,0,98,58,1]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,11,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,5,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n有谁知道徐庶是什么人？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[21,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n主公，我与徐庶同乡，\n非常了解此人。\n&曹操\n仲德，他是什么样的人？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[21,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n徐庶为人足智多谋，\n且行俠仗義。\n&程昱\n他为了替友人出一口气，\n犯下杀人罪行后就失踪了，\n想不到如今投奔了刘备……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[21,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n如今有了徐庶辅佐，\n恐怕日后难以击破刘备。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[21,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯……\n想不到你居然会这么说……"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[0,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n如果他肯为我效力，\n我定会高官厚禄重用他……\n偏偏却投奔了刘备……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[21,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n主公，现在还不到死心的时候。\n我有一计可以对付徐庶……"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[0,0,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n什么计策？\n&程昱\n其实徐庶的母亲就在许都。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[21,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n徐庶是个孝子，\n若能说服其母把他找来，\n他一定会投奔主公的。\n&曹操\n嗯……\n好吧，你马上去办。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[21,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n是。\n小人一定不负所托。"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[201,255]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":3,"offset":2587,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":2589,"title":"徐庶  来访","body_off":2610,"body_end":3869,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["徐庶  来访"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[16]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":2624,"cond":{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["過場CG"]},"end":32,"end_off":3137},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,52,65535]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[0,153,65535,65535,65535]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["此后程昱款待了徐母，",0,1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["试图劝她招徐庶前来许都，",1,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["可是徐母始终不肯答应。",1,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["程昱见劝说不行，",1,1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["就模仿徐母笔迹，",1,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["修了封伪书，",1,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["派人送给了徐庶。",1,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["徐庶不知是假，",0,1,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["为了孝顺母亲，",1,0,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["便辞别刘备来到曹操所在的许都。",1,1,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,8,65535]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[0,34,55,1,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[21,52,40,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[151,52,55,3,6]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[202,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["许都  相府"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n拜见丞相。\n我是徐庶徐元直。\n&曹操\n我就是曹孟德。\n元直，我等你很久了。\n&徐庶\n谢丞相抬爱。\n&曹操\n今后与令堂一起在许都生活，\n为我效力吧。\n&徐庶\n是，丞相。\n不知家母现在何处？\n&曹操\n令堂在城外的家中吧。\n&徐庶\n原来如此。\n在下急于见老母一面，就此告辞。\n&曹操\n嗯。安心地去吧。\n&徐庶\n多谢丞相。\n那么在下告辞了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[151,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,151,0,98,55,1]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,151,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n仲德，这次真的做得太好了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[21,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&程昱\n谢主公。\n&程昱\n（如果知道书信是假，\n徐庶不会为我军效力的。）\n&程昱\n（不过这样也好，\n刘备的力量已经被削弱了。）"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[202,255]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":4,"offset":3869,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":3871,"title":"徐庶  徐母之死","body_off":3896,"body_end":5642,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["徐庶  徐母之死"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,36,65535]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[152,53,42,2,0]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[202,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["许都  徐庶母亲住处"]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[151,53,90,0,0]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n母亲！\n&徐母\n元直！？"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,151,0,53,85,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,152,0,58,42,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,151,0,53,74,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,152,0,58,53,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,151,0,53,61,0]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,152,0,53,53,2]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[151,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n母亲，孩儿好思念您老人家。\n&徐母\n哦，元直，我们好久不见了吧。\n不过，你怎么会来这的？\n你不是正为刘皇叔效力吗？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[151,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n母亲何来此问？\n孩儿是因为接到母亲的书信，\n才辞别玄德主公回来的。\n&徐母\n我的书信？\n&徐庶\n是啊，在这儿呢。"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,151,0,53,57,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,151,0,53,61,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐母\n这是……？\n&徐母\n元直，你从小学习诗书，\n居然会相信这封假造的信……\n&徐庶\n假信！？\n&徐母\n你好糊涂啊……\n自己的母亲怎么会写这样的信呢！\n你难道连这都看不出来吗？"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[152,0,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐母\n想不到为了我这样的老妇，\n居然舍弃那么好的主公……\n&徐庶\n孩，孩儿……"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[152,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐母\n元直，你不知道忠胜于孝的道理吗…？\n太糊涂了…你怎么这么糊涂啊……"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,152,0,57,53,1]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐母\n都怪我这个老妇还活在世上……"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,152,0,57,98,2]},{"op":49,"name":"actor_select","args":[65535,152,0,0,0,0,65535]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[151,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n啊！母亲！"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[202,255]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[13]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[151,4,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n母亲……"]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[35,1]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[10]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&侍女01\n啊！！"]},{"op":51,"name":"actor_face","args":[151,0,2]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n什……什么事！？"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,37,65535]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[152,45,54,1,10]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[189,45,48,2,0]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[151,20,54,1,0]},{"op":30,"name":"wait_frame","args":[]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n母……母亲！！"]},{"op":50,"name":"actor_move","args":[65535,151,0,39,54,1]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[151,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&侍女01\n老夫人突……突然把刀\n刺进自己胸口……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[151,4]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n为……为什么会这样……？"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[151,9]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n母亲，都怪我太糊涂了……"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&徐庶\n母……母亲！！\n呜呜喔喔！！"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"index":5,"offset":5642,"sections":[{"index":0,"offset":5644,"title":"孔明  出场","body_off":5665,"body_end":7931,"conditions":[{"op":2,"name":"comment","args":["孔明  出场"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}],"body":[{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[16]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":24,"name":"title_text","args":["诸葛孔明出场"]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[1,65535,0,65535,65535]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["此时，",0,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[8]},{"op":41,"name":"op_29","args":[35,311,178]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["襄阳西面的隆中小村中，有位人称卧龙的贤士，",1,1,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["他叫做诸葛亮。",1,1,1]},{"op":41,"name":"op_29","args":[32,233,142]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["新野的刘备",0,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":42,"name":"op_2a","args":[32,247,178]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["三顾茅庐委请诸葛亮，",1,0,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":42,"name":"op_2a","args":[32,223,142]},{"op":42,"name":"op_2a","args":[35,287,142]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[5]},{"op":44,"name":"caption","args":["终于成功地请他出山做了军师。",1,1,1]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":39,"name":"change_scene","args":[2,65535,65535,8,65535]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[0,34,55,1,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[20,52,40,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[23,58,40,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[24,64,40,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[21,70,40,2,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[1,52,70,0,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[15,58,70,0,0]},{"op":48,"name":"actor_appear","args":[2,64,70,0,0]},{"op":28,"name":"fade_out","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[200,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":23,"name":"place_name","args":["许都  相府"]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n刚才接到报告，\n听说刘备又找了一个叫诸葛亮的军师，\n正在整治军务加强操练。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n刘备失去徐庶后，\n又找来一个军师……\n&荀彧\n想必此人一定更加出色。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n嗯。\n&曹操\n既然有这样的能人辅佐刘备，\n如果不趁现在消灭他们，\n日后就更棘手了。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n刚才就说什么诸葛亮的，\n不就是一个年轻书生吗？\n孟德，让我去讨伐刘备吧。\n&曹操\n你啊？元让……"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n孔明值得大惊小怪吗！\n不过是个毛头小子，\n我看没什么了不起的。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,6]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&荀彧\n夏侯惇将军，不可过于大意啊。"]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[20,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&夏侯惇\n荀彧先生你说说看，\n我夏侯惇你总信得过吧！\n打了这么多仗，我经验老到得很。\n&荀彧\n在下相当清楚将军的实力……\n主公，您意下如何？\n&曹操\n嗯……"]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[200,255]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[11]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":7087,"cond":{"op":18,"name":"choice","args":["同意让夏侯惇攻打刘备\n等孔明的消息到了再说",0]},"end":73,"end_off":7836},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":7141,"cond":{"op":19,"name":"test_choice","args":[1]},"end":65,"end_off":7354},{"op":58,"name":"set_resource","args":[2,2,2]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[200,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n好吧，既然你这么说的话。\n元让，就派你去讨伐刘备。\n&曹操\n不过，你说了这么多大话，\n如果打了败仗，我一定要严惩。\n&夏侯惇\n好！到那时我就把脑袋交给你。"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":1,"name":"if","args":[],"off":7354,"cond":{"op":19,"name":"test_choice","args":[2]},"end":72,"end_off":7834},{"op":58,"name":"set_resource","args":[2,1,2]},{"op":36,"name":"play_sound","args":[255]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[200,0]},{"op":9,"name":"delay","args":[3]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n元让，你的精神可嘉，\n不过还是等有了孔明的情报再说吧。\n&夏侯惇\n什……什么！？\n就算孟德这么说，\n我还是不能理解！\n&夏侯惇\n你们以为我夏侯惇，\n会败给孔明那个小毛头吗！？\n&曹操\n我不是这个意思，\n总之还是小心点好。\n&夏侯惇\n不管您怎么说，\n就让我去对付孔明吧？\n&曹操\n你敢保证自己不会输？\n&夏侯惇\n当然！就赌我这颗项上人头。\n&曹操\n好吧。\n既然你这么说，我同意出兵，\n不过，刚才你说的话可别忘了。\n&夏侯惇\n嗯！\n我夏侯惇一言九鼎！"]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]},{"op":52,"name":"actor_action","args":[1,0]},{"op":20,"name":"dialog","args":["&曹操\n好！让于禁和李典同往，\n也好助你一臂之力，\n就看你们的了。"]},{"op":29,"name":"fade_in","args":[]},{"op":35,"name":"play_music","args":[200,255]},{"op":47,"name":"op_2f","args":[]},{"op":0,"name":"end","args":[]}]}]},{"i